{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1595325,\"title\":\"The Anacondas\",\"tagline\":\"You're hisstory!\",\"overview\":\"Explorers in Mexico uncover the ruins of an ancient snake-worshiping civilization. Celebration turns to horror when they awaken an ever-growing anaconda, starved of human sacrifices for centuries. Now, the team must band together to survive.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yphysF14qWFvrIbFVg3vEnbudwT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ryA5uYC7mVZv9dEnAGvL9Iv8kVZ.jpg\",\"rating\":3.5,\"voteCount\":21,\"year\":2025,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Horror\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Marcel Walz\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":228632,\"name\":\"Marcel Walz\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zorcLcvnUGTa4hirNuOhvYcg7lF.jpg\"},{\"id\":2896531,\"name\":\"Hannah Hueston\",\"character\":\"Amy Briars\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wc48icP82y3WoI37w3gqBWNUbiQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":5056548,\"name\":\"Jordan Iverach\",\"character\":\"Irving Jones\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A9zFtB9YmU4izbD7eNtEqYfbhKZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1212104,\"name\":\"Philipp Karner\",\"character\":\"Steve Bell\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ubw2BP4sxr2EOnATeG7O7jG2bx5.jpg\"},{\"id\":23790,\"name\":\"Dominic Keating\",\"character\":\"Dr. Agustin Stiglitz\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eRe4BJz9fTztlRKikDRHhmss6ee.jpg\"},{\"id\":163503,\"name\":\"Maureen Kedes\",\"character\":\"Bella Jacobs\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vWhGJCC2QXDe6S15dbXjdRAc9yJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":4479427,\"name\":\"Bix Krieger\",\"character\":\"Jess Mansfield\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xrNatpwrSauF3MsmWLviG18rNW0.jpg\"},{\"id\":5865554,\"name\":\"Giselle Garci\",\"character\":\"Ichtaca\",\"photo\":\"https://image