,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A soldier and his team battle hordes of post-apocalyptic zombies in the wastelands of the Korean Peninsula.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":282035,\"title\":\"The Mummy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zxkY8byBnCsXodEYpK8tmwEGXBI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i4ZougHEyBAboDpi6jsaTUDTjUl.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Though safely entombed in a crypt deep beneath the unforgiving desert, an ancient queen whose destiny was unjustly taken from her is awakened in our current day, bringing with her malevolence grown over millennia, and terrors that defy human comprehension.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Thriller\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":395,\"title\":\"AVP: Alien vs. Predator\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2DKoPom57PVtJWcJlq7bS7JpahU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xvq1RLaiwSdHwPHe7WUhqZa1rCA.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When scientists discover something near Antarctica that appears to be a buried Pyramid, they send a research team out to investigate. Little do they know that they are about to step into a hunting ground where Aliens are grown as sport for the Predator race.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":443791,\"title\":\"Underwater\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gzlbb3yeVISpQ3REd3Ga1scWGTU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tya34K7D4jtDrVbvExyvTx97Aen.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After an earthquake destroys their underwater station, six researchers must navigate two miles along the dangerous, unknown depths of the ocean floor to make it to safety in a race against time.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":456740,\"title\":\"Hellboy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bk8LyaMqUtaQ9hUShuvFznQYQKR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/djiDKVB07xTy7tDFbWb9k7KLI3E.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Hellboy comes to England, where he must defeat Nimue, Merlin's consort and the Blood Queen. But their battle will bring about the end of the world, a fate he desperately tries to turn away.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":324544,\"title\":\"In the Lost Lands\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dDlfjR7gllmr8HTeN6rfrYhTdwX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oI5uHu7lrQ0mBBH1c8OHCAkCq4x.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A queen sends the powerful and feared sorceress Gray Alys to the ghostly wilderness of the Lost Lands in search of a magical power, where she and her guide, the drifter Boyce, must outwit and outfight both man and demon.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":760741,\"title\":\"Beast\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f18rGcLlawKjNC5KRh36S0mvRlY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pz7bGOUNJXyPKJ2GcJN6nhwBnCs.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A recently widowed man and his two teenage daughters travel to a game reserve in South Africa. However, their journey of healing soon turns into a fight for survival when a bloodthirsty lion starts to stalk them.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":726139,\"title\":\"Project Silence\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lZT5Cq4wkz7IeJEnz94U94xuEWD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cIBp7rip1kZLSD7BQrEE4UXs6aq.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Due to sudden deteriorating weather conditions, visibility on the Airport Bridge is severely impaired, leaving people stranded and at risk of the bridge collapsing due to a series of chain collisions and explosions. Amidst the chaos, the canine subjects \\\"Echo\\\" from the military experiment \\\"Project Silence,\\\" who were being transported in secret, break free, and all human survivors become targets of relentless attacks.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Action\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9042,\"title\":\"The Cave\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gMfJo22XulGLA8h8yAjiLhdQusv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hHhZBHknSjrtSnIEVqQtAjMBNu9.jpg\",\"rating\":5.4,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a group of biologists discovers a huge network of unexplored caves in Romania and, believing it to be an undisturbed eco-system that has produced a new species, they hire the best American team of underwater cave explorers in the world. While exploring deeper into the underwater caves, a rockslide blocks their exit, and they soon discover a larger carnivorous creature has added them to its food chain.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10304,\"title\":\"Starship Troopers 2: Hero of the Federation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9iqrqOjLaFcGNnSQlJxYLfgrhqn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/VFQsmdsqyKWdMi2Pb77cAD4akk.jpg\",\"rating\":4.4,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of troopers take refuge in an abandoned outpost after fighting alien bugs, failing to realize that more danger lays in wait.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Horror\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"isictB6aypQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}